---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Legacy | Praveen Venkatesh"
  description="Earlier work and personal notes from praveenvnktsh.github.io."
  mode="home"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Legacy</span>
        <h1 class="section-title">Praveen Venkatesh</h1>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Hello World! I am a graduate student at Carnegie Mellon University, Robotics Institute.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="legacy-intro">
        <ul class="legacy-list">
          <li>Passionate about giving sight to robots.</li>
          <li>Currently building robotic systems that can assist humans.</li>
          <li>Love tinkering with robots and experimenting with crazy ideas.</li>
          <li>Absolutely love teaching and disseminating knowledge in intuitive ways.</li>
          <li>Triple Gold Medallist from IIT Gandhinagar.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-[var(--color-bg-secondary)]">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Works</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">My Works</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Some uber cool things I've done in the past.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="role-grid">
        <div class="role-card">
          <h3>Alfred</h3>
          <p>Robots for the elderly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <h3>Experimenting with RL</h3>
          <p>PPO + A2C | Genetic Evolution.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <h3>FFRRT*</h3>
          <p>Flexible Formation Rapidly exploring Random Trees.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Personal</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Some Things About Me</h2>
      </div>

      <ul class="legacy-list">
        <li>I can solve the 3x3 cube in around 13 seconds and solve 14 twisty puzzles.</li>
        <li>I go on typeracer and type at 100 WPM when I feel like it.</li>
        <li>Music = ❤️</li>
        <li>Competitive table tennis player (ex-state player from TN).</li>
        <li>I can play the keyboard.</li>
        <li>I play a lot of games (gamerTag: flyingMango).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-[var(--color-bg-secondary)]">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Memories</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Snapshots</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="legacy-gallery">
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/medals.JPG" alt="Convocation medals" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Convocation | Receiving medals</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/deanslist.jpg" alt="Dean's list recognition" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Receiving Dean's List</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/invent.jpg" alt="Invent at IITGN" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Invent@IITGN 2019</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/interiit_1.jpg" alt="Inter IIT team" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Inter IIT team</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/latex.jpg" alt="Team LaTeX" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Team LaTeX 2018</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/iitl.jpg" alt="IIT Gandhinagar campus" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>IIT Gandhinagar</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legacy-intro {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legacy-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legacy-list li + li {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }

  .legacy-gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legacy-gallery figure {
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  }

  .legacy-gallery img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 180px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .legacy-gallery figcaption {
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
